			"notes": "# 1.0.1\n## Added\n- Added exit radiation zone bar animation for the mod version.\n- Added the visual flags of radiation zone in the mod version.\n## Changed\n- Deleted legacy code from Craftserve versions of the plugin.\n- Changed compatibility level of plugin, it is now supported by Spigot and Bukkit.\n- Merged neoforge and fabric version with common module without Architectury API requirement.\n- Gradle no longer build `-sources` jar file.\n## Fixed\n- Fixed exit radiation zone bar animation that stops too early on the plugin version.\n- Fixed radiation bar color on the mod version.\n- Fixed unnecessary radiation effects after death."
		},
